    <item>
      <title>2021年广汽资本参投长鑫科技，五年后IPO与LPDDR6量产兑现回报</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260905/2021%E5%B9%B4%E5%B9%BF%E6%B1%BD%E8%B5%84%E6%9C%AC%E5%8F%82%E6%8A%95%E9%95%BF%E9%91%AB%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E4%BA%94%E5%B9%B4%E5%90%8EIPO%E4%B8%8ELPDDR6%E9%87%8F%E4%BA%A7%E5%85%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%9B%9E%E6%8A%A5/</link>
